Desktop UI	PySide6	Modern Windows desktop application
SSH connection	Paramiko	Connect to Unix/Linux servers
File operations	SFTP or approved remote commands	Check NAS paths through the server
PostgreSQL	psycopg	Database connectivity
Oracle	python-oracledb	Oracle database connectivity
Other databases	Appropriate vendor driver	Support your actual database environment
Local configuration	JSON or YAML	Store non-secret connection profiles
Credential storage	Windows Credential Manager or approved enterprise vault	Protect credentials
Background tasks	QThread or QThreadPool	Run checks without freezing the UI
Charts	PySide6-compatible charting	Display health metrics and trends
Reporting	CSV, HTML and PDF libraries	Export support reports
