If a job usually completes in 8 minutes but has been running for 25 minutes, flag it for investigation.

C. Return-code analysis

Display the return code, associated log entries and previous failure history.

D. Job execution comparison

Compare the current execution with the last successful execution.

E. Failed-job impact analysis

Identify which feeds, application stages and downstream jobs depend on a failed job.

F. Controlled rerun workflow

Provide a rerun option only for authorised users. Before execution, show the impact, prerequisites and confirmation screen.

